			(property "Description" "SMD Shielded Power Inductor\n\nCharacteristics\n\nMagnetically shielded version which results in a low leakage field\n\nHigh Saturation currents up to 25 A\n\nVery low self-losses at high switching frequency‘s\n\nWide inductances spectrum available at all sizes\n\nOperating temperature: –40 °C to +125 °C\n\nApplications\n\nPerfectly suitable for switching regulators with extremely high efficiency\n\nIntegrated DC/DC- converter\n\nSwitching regulators with low operating voltages (Graphic cards, embedded PC-Cards, Mainboards)\n\nPlastic base: Because of the one piece construction these are more suitable for high vibration or shock applications\n\nhttp://katalog.we-online.de/media/images/v2/Family_WE-PD.jpg\n\nDetails see: http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-PD? http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-PD?\n\nUpdated  by  Dan Xu 2014-07-08\n2014 (C) Wurth Elektronik"
